# The proposed outputs, top to bottom, as one session.
#
# Walks every surface in the owner's mock in order: /enterprise, /function,
# /staff, /add-human-worker, /task, /tasks, task details, /create-human-task,
# /human-tasks, /complete-human-task. Not a filmed scenario -- it exists to
# put the new copy on screen so it can be read against the drawing.
/reset
yes
/clear
@timeout 300
/enterprise
