Pick, pack and dispatch the day's orders.
skip
@staff /staff
/add-human-worker
Warehouse Lead
1
lead@example.com
@note the task surfaces
/task
1
List what a picker must check before sealing a box.
1
@wait 120
/tasks
/task
2
1
@note the human-task surfaces
